OL,3,GNEWSARow reignited over square named
OL,4,Aafter slave trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor wants to see the name of
OL,7,Fthe man known as Britain's first slave
OL,8,Ftrader reinstated on signs in a square
OL,9,Fnamed after him in Plymouth.
OL,11,FAll of the street signs for Sir John
OL,12,FHawkins Square were removed in 2020 as
OL,13,FPlymouth City Council sought to "stand
OL,14,Fin solidarity with the Black Lives
OL,15,FMatter movement".
OL,17,FThe council tried to get the site
OL,18,Frenamed as Justice Square but had to
OL,19,Fdrop that plan due to a legal challenge
OL,20,Fand a change in the law related to the
OL,21,Frenaming of streets.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
