OL,3,GNEWSARow reignited over square named
OL,4,Aafter slave trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Rose, Reform UK councillor for St
OL,7,FPeter and the Waterfront, said the name
OL,8,Fof the square was "part of the city's
OL,9,Fhistory" and has called on the city
OL,10,Fcouncil to take immediate action to
OL,11,Freplace the original signs.
